    "terrainName": "berlin",
    "description": "What: on berlin a STOCHASTIC 'Blue Stochastic Squad' (10 men) holds (300,300) under a Defend order; a PHYSICAL 'Red Patrol' 550 m north marches away north. Judge (X-2): (1) the squad splits while the patrol is near and runs SquadDefend; (2) once the patrol is past the 800 m merge line and 30 s are quiet the men merge back; (3) within 3 s it runs the stochastic StochasticUnitDefend - the same order - and never SquadDefend again; (4) no roster is left on it. Fail: SquadDefend on a memberless unit, no order after the merge, or a roster left behind. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh agg-merge-keeps-order"
  },
